{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>יָדַי</b>, יִסַּדוּ — past tense verb." "<b>תִּבְצַעְנָה</b> — they shall be completed, as in: כִּי יִבְצַע יְהוָה אֶת כָּל מַעֲשֵׂהוּ (for YHWH will complete all His deed)." "<b>וְיָדַעַתְּ</b> — He speaks to Zerubbabel, who stands in place of all Israel." "<b>שְׁלָחַנִי אֲלֵיכֶם</b> — to him and to all Israel."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:59.305073430Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}